Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs40\pos(183.2,285.867)}Ghost Meets Gal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still tired from\Nstaying up late last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lubnacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Santhi's voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(56.8,98.133)}{\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\pos(68,204.8)\fs15}\NLilfa\NYoung Giantess
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look! Cool, right?\NWe met on my morning walk and hit it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, I'm Lilfa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't eat Santhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I would!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I met Sister Feltyrosa on a walk last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and she made me an honorary little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? I want her to make me one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:00:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I accidentally hit you with my sneeze.\NAre you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I accidentally hit you with my sneeze.\NAre you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(75.2,67.2)}{\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\pos(68,204.8)\fs18}Michu\NA Battleroid Girl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you even live like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyday must be so hyped!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\fs18\pos(74.4,276.267)}Sagitta\NJudge Maiden
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Michu, you've done it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prefect!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But it hasn't gotten as bad as last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Apprehended!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.78,0:01:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The serial hugger who's been\Nzapping students all over campus...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...I've apprehended you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.66,0:01:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Waaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've been...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...so you've been hugging\Nother students besides me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's just kind of how I greet people?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}Looking down, sighing, \Nhiding my true feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}Every time i step forward, \Neven if i'm trembling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}I can't lie to my desire of change!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs22\pos(188.8,286.933)}It's surely a distant dream right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23\pos(202.4,286.933)}but i want to chase it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}Even if our futures are different colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}Let's paint them with the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs18\pos(189.6,286.933)}Because you are the one who gives me courage!
